+  `organizer_phone_call_command_start/status/cancel` tools are connected in both
+  desktop catalogs. Dial, answer and end use the existing native Linux/C# actors
+  with source/fingerprint checks, a private operation owner and correlated
+  command receipts. A retained authenticated call event is not a fresh phone OS
+  query; a local receipt or transport ACK is not a phone result or delivery
+  confirmation. Cancellation cannot recall a claimed dispatch. The exact
+  contracts are documented in [mcp.md](mcp.md#native-call-context-and-commands);
+  physical handset and combined installed acceptance remain separate.
